PositionFactory::initialize(address,address)
├── when admin is zero address
│   └── it should revert with PositionFactoryZeroAddress
├── when _marketRegistry is zero address
│   └── it should revert with PositionFactoryZeroAddress
└── when admin and _marketRegistry are valid
    ├── it should set marketRegistry
    ├── it should emit MarketRegistrySet
    ├── it should set owner to admin
    └── it should not allow re-initialization
